title: Heartland Government Collapses
subtitle: Our coalition partners are dissolving the Heartland government.
view-if: ((((ddp_relation < 50 and ddp_ideology == "Right") or (ddp_relation < 40 and ddp_ideology == "Moderate") or (ddp_relation < 30 and ddp_ideology == "Left")) and not lvp_formed) or (((lvp_relation < 55 and lvp_ideology == "Right") or (lvp_relation < 45 and lvp_ideology == "Moderate") or (lvp_relation < 35 and lvp_ideology == "Left")) and lvp_formed)) and in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland
on-arrival: coalition_dissent += 2 if in_social_liberal_coalition; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 0; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 0; was_in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; was_in_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; was_in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 1 if in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland == 1 or in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_heartland == 1; was_in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 1 if in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland == 1 or in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_heartland == 1; was_in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 1 if ((in_weimar_coalition_heartland == 1 or in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland == 1) or (in_grand_coalition_heartland == 1 and lvp_formed)); was_in_grand_coalition_heartland = 1 if (in_grand_coalition_heartland == 1 or in_minority_grand_coalition_heartland == 1); in_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 0; in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 0; in_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; in_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_grand_coalition_heartland = 0; in_popular_front_heartland = 0; in_left_front_heartland = 0; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 0; in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_far_right_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_social_catholic_coalition_heartland = 0; in_minority_social_liberal_coalition_heartland = 0; marcher_heartland = 0; right_heartland = 0; ddp_in_popular_front_heartland = 0; collectivist_goals_seen_heartland = 0; marcher_toleration_heartland = 0
on-departure: {!
if (Q.in_social_catholic_coalition_heartland || Q.in_social_liberal_coalition_heartland || Q.in_weimar_coalition_heartland == 1 || Q.in_grand_coalition_heartland == 1 || Q.in_popular_front_heartland == 1 || Q.in_left_front_heartland == 1 || Q.in_marcher_majority_heartland == 1 || Q.in_minority_weimar_coalition_heartland == 1 || Q.in_minority_grand_coalition_heartland == 1) {
    Q.marcher_heartland = 1;
    Q.right_heartland = 0;
} else if (Q.in_right_coalition_heartland == 1 || Q.in_center_right_coalition_heartland == 1 || Q.heartland_leader == "Goodryke" || Q.heartland_leader == "Gorrick" || Q.in_far_right_coalition_heartland == 1) {
    Q.right_heartland = 1;
    Q.marcher_heartland = 0;
}
!}
new-page: true
tags: event
face-image: img/weimar_coalition_3.jpg

= Democratic Bulwark Dismantled

We have somehow antagonized the <span style="color: #FFCC00;">liberals</span> involved in the <span style="color: #c00000;">Social</span>-[? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">Liberal</span>?][? if lvp_formed: <span style="color: #FFCC00;">Liberal</span>?] Coalition ruling over Heartland, and they have called a vote of no confidence against us.

[? if marcher_r_heartland + collectivist_r_heartland + sapd_r_heartland < 50: The only alternative coalition that can be formed with the current composition of the state parliament is a broad right-wing coalition, ranging from the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] to the [? if center_right_coalition_heartland >= 50: <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>?][? if center_right_coalition_heartland < 50: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span>?]. [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" and not traditionalist_westarp: However, this is heavily unlikely with the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span>'s all-or-nothing stance on governance. ?]?][? if marcher_r_heartland + collectivist_r_heartland + sapd_r_heartland >= 50: New elections will have to be called, as all parties to our right lack the votes necessary to form an alternative majority coalition—even if they were to unite behind a single candidate. ?]

- @spd_majority
- @far_right_coalition_prussia
- @right_coalition
- @center_right_coalition
- @bourgeois_coalition
- @bourgeois_coalition_kvp
- @left_coalition
- @new_elections: New elections will be called.


@spd_majority
title: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> majority alone
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>: [+ marcher_r_heartland +]%
view-if: marcher_r_heartland >= 50
on-arrival: pro_republic += 5; army_loyalty -= 0.05 if chancellor == "Bristol"; ddp_right += 2; gold_right += 4; lvp_right += 3; liberal_cooperation += 5; bourgeois_cooperation += 5; heartland_leader = "Bristol"; in_marcher_majority_heartland = 1; heartland_police_loyalty += 0.1; heartland_police_strength += 50; democratization += 3; coup_progress += 1; capital_strike_progress += 2; ddp_relation -= 3; lvp_relation -= 3; unionist_relation -= 3; marcher_heartland = 1

Finally, the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> can govern alone! Our long campaign of electioneering has paid off. We do not need to worry about coalition government; anything is possible. However, our former coalition partners are going to start drifting to the right.

Bristol is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@far_right_coalition_prussia
title: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Far</span>-[? if not dnf_formed:<span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>?][? if dnf_formed:<span style="color: #003755;">right</span>?] Coalition
subtitle: <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Royalists**</span> + [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span> ?] ([+ far_right_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: far_right_coalition_heartland >= 50
on-arrival: in_far_right_coalition_heartland = 1; coup_progress += 5; landed_royalist += 10; commons_royalist += 10; burgher_royalist += 10; guild_royalist += 10; disfavored_royalist += 10; commons_marcher -= 5; commons_collectivist -= 5; heartland_leader = "Gorrick"; warden_strength += 100; warden_militancy += 0.1; loyalist_strength += 200; loyalist_militancy += 0.1; vanguard_banned = 1; vanguard_strength -= 50; banner_strength -= 200; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.5

There are enough votes for the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalists</span> and the [? if traditionalist_ideology == "Radical": <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ?][? if traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate": <span style="color: #003755;">**DNF**</span> ?] to form a coalition. Ulric Gorrick is elevated to the position of Minister-President and immediately starts dismantling its democratic institutions.

A wave of terror and repression unfolds, targeting the <span style="color: #c00000;">socialists</span> and <span style="color: #700000;">communists</span>. Violence erupts in the streets, with bullets flying and leftists being killed or imprisoned.

@right_coalition
title: A Bürgerblock is formed.
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed and gold_exist: <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> + **Others** ([+ right_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?][? if lvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span> + Others ([+ right_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if (traditionalist_ideology == "Radical" and not traditionalist_westarp) or (year = 1929 and month >= 7):- The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span> is not interested in a coalition with the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?].?]
view-if: right_coalition_heartland >= 50 and not concord_formed
choose-if: (traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate" or traditionalist_westarp) and not (year = 1929 and month >= 7)
on-arrival: in_right_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; burgher_marcher -= 4; landed_marcher -= 2; gold_right += 1; center_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 20; reformist_dissent += 20; knight_dissent += 10; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; lvp_right += 1; reformist_dissent += 10; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; heartland_police_strength -= 10; pro_republic -= 3; ddp_relation -= 4; unionist_relation -= 4; gold_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 4

A right coalition is formed, albeit with an extremely narrow majority. They will begin undoing years of reform and democratization that we fought hard to achieve and will let <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">wing</span> paramilitaries like the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Wardens</span> and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> run free.

It won't take long for the government to collapse and for us to take power through new elections. But when it eventually does, we won't have much allies as our former coalition partners are beginning to shift to the right. When the time comes, who will stand with us?

[? if unionist_leader != "Sedgewick": Adam Sedgewick?][? if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick": Edmund Askew?] of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@center_right_coalition
title: A Bürgerblock is formed.
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + Others + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span> ([+ center_right_coalition_heartland +]%) [? if (year = 1929 and month >= 7): The <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Traditionalists</span> is not interested in a coalition with the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionists</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?].?]
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others** + <span style="color: #3E88B3;">**Traditionalists**</span> ([+ center_right_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: traditionalist_ideology == "Moderate" and center_right_coalition_heartland >= 50 and dnf_formed and right_coalition_heartland < 50 and not lvp_formed and not concord_formed
choose-if: not (year = 1929 and month >= 7)
on-arrival: in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; burgher_marcher -= 4; ddp_right += 1; ddp_cohesion -= 1; gold_right += 1; lvp_right += 1; center_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 20; reformist_dissent += 20; knight_dissent += 10; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.06; heartland_police_strength -= 8; pro_republic -= 3; ddp_relation -= 4; unionist_relation -= 4; gold_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 4

A center-right coalition is formed featuring an broad array of parties to the right of us. They will begin undoing years of reform and democratization that we fought hard to achieve and will let <span style="color: #3E88B3;">right</span>-<span style="color: #7A3C00;">wing</span> paramilitaries like the <span style="color: #3E88B3;">Wardens</span> and the <span style="color: #7A3C00;">Royalist</span> <span style="color: #7A3C00;">**Loyalists**</span> run free.

It won't take long for the government to collapse and for us to take power through new elections. But when it eventually does, we won't have much allies as our former coalition partners are beginning to shift to the right. When the time comes, who will stand with us?

[? if unionist_leader != "Sedgewick": Adam Sedgewick?][? if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick": Edmund Askew?] of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@bourgeois_coalition
title: A Bürgerblock is formed.
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + Others ([+ center_right_coalition_heartland +]%)
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others** ([+ center_right_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: concord_formed and center_right_coalition_heartland >= 50
on-arrival: in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; burgher_marcher -= 4; ddp_right += 2; ddp_cohesion -= 2; gold_right += 3; lvp_right += 3; center_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 20; reformist_dissent += 20; knight_dissent += 10; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.08; heartland_police_strength -= 15; pro_republic -= 3; ddp_relation -= 5; unionist_relation -= 5; gold_relation -= 5; lvp_relation -= 5

Letting go the democratic bulwark to the right-wing parties is deeply unpopular among all party members, and provides no discernible benefit. 

[? if unionist_leader != "Sedgewick": Adam Sedgewick?][? if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick": Edmund Askew?] of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@bourgeois_coalition_kvp
title: A Bürgerblock is formed.
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">[+ unionist_party_name +]</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">[+ ddp_name +]</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">Golds</span>?] + Others[? if kvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>?] ([+ bourgeois_coalition_heartland +]%)
subtitle: <span style="color: #000000;">**[+ unionist_party_name +]**</span> + [? if not lvp_formed: <span style="color: #D3C24D;">**[+ ddp_name +]**</span>[? if gold_exist:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?]?][? if lvp_formed:<span style="color: #C0A054;">**Golds**</span>?] + **Others**[? if kvp_formed:&nbsp;+ <span style="color: #0087DC;">**KVP**</span>?] ([+ bourgeois_coalition_heartland +]%)
view-if: bourgeois_coalition_heartland >= 50 and not concord_formed
on-arrival: in_center_right_coalition_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Sedgewick"; heartland_leader = "Askew" if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick"; burgher_marcher -= 4; ddp_right += 2; ddp_cohesion -= 2; gold_right += 2; lvp_right += 2; center_dissent += 10; left_dissent += 5; labor_dissent += 20; reformist_dissent += 20; knight_dissent += 10; ddp_right += 1; lvp_right += 3; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.06; heartland_police_strength -= 8; pro_republic -= 3; ddp_relation -= 4; unionist_relation -= 4; gold_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 4

Letting go the democratic bulwark to the right-wing parties is deeply unpopular among all party members, and provides no discernible benefit. Our members are furious that we have alienated the bourgeois parties enough to let this happen.

[? if unionist_leader != "Sedgewick": Adam Sedgewick?][? if unionist_leader == "Sedgewick": Edmund Askew?] of the [? if unionist_party_name != "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">Unionist Party</span>?][? if unionist_party_name == "Concord": <span style="color: #000000;">**Concord**</span>?] is selected to be the Minister-President of Heartland.

@left_coalition
title: Is a United Left coalition possible?
subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> [? if sapd_formed: + <span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span> ?] ([+ left_coalition_heartland +]%)
unavailable-subtitle: <span style="color: #c00000;">Marchers</span> + <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span> [? if sapd_formed: + <span style="color: #9B0000;">SAPD</span> ?] ([+ left_coalition_heartland +]%). [? if collectivist_relation < 50 : We do not have adequate relations with the <span style="color: #700000;">Collectivists</span>. ?][? if communist_coalition < 3 : The <span style="color: #700000;">Communists</span> are too committed to their radical ways to partake in government. ?] [? if (president_ideology == "Right" or president == "DuFour") and not presidential_powers: [+ president +] will perform a <i>Commonwealth intervention</i> upon our government. ?] [? if reformist_strength >= left_strength: Our own Heartland party has ruled out this possibility. ?]
view-if: left_coalition_heartland >= 50
choose-if: (collectivist_relation >= 50 or (collectivist_leader == "Conciliators" and collectivist_relation >= 40)) and communist_coalition >= 3 and ((president_ideology != "Right" and president != "DuFour") or presidential_powers) and left_strength >= reformist_strength
on-arrival: in_left_front_heartland = 1; heartland_leader = "Pendrigon"; army_loyalty -= 0.05; gold_right += 5; ddp_right += 3; ddp_cohesion -= 2; lvp_right += 3; liberal_cooperation += 5; bourgeois_cooperation += 10; collectivist_relation += 10; unionist_relation -= 4; ddp_relation -= 4; lvp_relation -= 8; gold_relation -= 8; coup_progress += 2; coup_progress += 1 if in_left_front; capital_strike_progress += 2; capital_strike_progress += 1 if in_left_front; reformist_dissent += 25; reformist_strength -= 15; left_dissent -= 15; left_strength += 15; heartland_police_loyalty -= 0.1; vanguard_strength += 50; vanguard_militancy += 0.05; marcher_heartland = 1

Somehow, surprisingly, the left coalition is successfully formed, without appointing a <span style="color: #700000;">communist</span> as Minister-President. The consensus choice for Minister-President, accepted by the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>, is[? if left_split == 1:&nbsp;<span style="color: #9B0000;">**SAPD**</span> member?] Cael Pendrigon, who [? if left_split == 0: belongs?][? if left_split == 1: belonged?] to the left faction of the <span style="color: #c00000;">**Marchers**</span>, and had a history of defending <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> members through his work..

In response to the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span>'s entrance into the government, the right-wing takes a "wait-and-see" approach for now. They expect that our government will be unstable and incompetent, and will collapse of its own accord, eventually enabling the destruction of the Unity Republic. [? if in_left_front: The right will be more active in resisting our rule considering we are also ruling with the <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> on the federal level too. ?]

- @prussia_election_1928.kpd_goals_prussia: The <span style="color: #700000;">**Collectivists**</span> presents us with a list of demands.

@new_elections
on-arrival: pro_republic -= 5; landed_marcher -= 4; burgher_marcher -= 4; guild_marcher -= 4; commons_marcher -= 3; landed_royalist += 4; burgher_royalist += 4; guild_royalist += 4; commons_royalist += 3
call: set_next_election_time_prussia

No coalition is able to be formed, forcing [+ heartland_leader +] to call new elections, with the extremist parties likely to benefit from.

New Heartland elections have been set for [+ next_election_month_heartland : month +] [+ next_election_year_heartland +]. 